     "body": "<p>Discussion at May 28, 2020 community call about this and a decision was reached to alter the containment index to have a \"deleted\" flag, when a hierarchy is deleted then containment relationships are marked as deleted to avoid revealing them but can still be used when purging the same hierarchy.</p>",
